  {
    "name": "onboarding_disclaimer_body",
    "text": "This app and its modules are intended solely for personal device management and productivity enhancements, not for circumventing regulations, access controls, or unauthorized operations.\\n\\nPlease ensure you understand how these features work, and take responsibility for any rules, modifications, or settings enabled.",
