  {
    "name": "privacy_policy_title",
    "text": "Privacy policy",
    "source": "en"
  },
  {
    "name": "privacy_policy_subtitle",
    "text": "How data is handled and whether it is uploaded",
    "source": "en"
  },
  {
    "name": "privacy_policy_entry_title",
    "text": "Privacy policy",
    "source": "en"
  },
  {
    "name": "privacy_policy_entry_desc",
    "text": "Local data handling and permission purposes",
    "source": "en"
  },
  {
    "name": "privacy_policy_body",
    "text": "XGesture is designed around on-device processing.\n\n• Notifications and OTP: read, filtered, extracted, and displayed locally only. Nothing is uploaded by default.\n• OTP records and notification history: stored in app-private storage and excluded from system backup by default; optional export in settings backup.\n• LSPosed / Shizuku: optional enhancements that you enable yourself.\n• We do not collect personally identifiable information or send this data to developer servers.\n\nForeground service (special use): OverlayService keeps edge gestures and shake detection alive with subtype overlay_sidebar\\u2014not for ads or unrelated background work.\n\nQuestions: open a GitHub Issue on the project repository.",
    "source": "en"
  },
